Files: rtl/vax/vms/*
Copyright: 1978-1991 Digital Equipment Corporation
           2026 T. Kurt Bond
License: BSD-3-Clause
Comment: Generated by tools/sdloberon from STARLETSD.TLB of VAX/VMS 5.5-2
 (doc/developer/vms-sdl-interfaces.md); each keeps the comments of its SDL
 source, Digital's copyright notice among them. These modules make up the
 VMSDEF library of peaseblossom-vax.

Files: rtl/llvm/valgrind.h rtl/llvm/memcheck.h
Copyright: 2000-2017 Julian Seward
License: bzip2-1.0.6
Comment: Valgrind 3.27.1's valgrind.h and memcheck.h, unchanged, whose
 client requests Coroutines.c uses to register each coroutine's stack with
 valgrind (doc/developer/coroutines-under-valgrind.md) and
 GarbageCollectedHeap.c to read the stacks' words as defined
 (doc/developer/collector-under-valgrind.md). Its licence, bzip2-1.0.6
 (BSD-style), covers these two files only; the rest of Valgrind, which is
 not included, is GPL 3.

